1
00:03:21,599 --> 00:03:27,599
Autumn Dreams is a tv movie, romance film directed by Neill Fearnley.

2
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:49,199
With plans to leave their small town, teenage loves Annie and Ben elope.

3
00:10:04,799 --> 00:10:10,799
Their big city plans are halted, though, when Annie's
parents have the marriage annulled.

4
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:32,399
Ben moves to New York, while Annie stays in Iowa to help her family.

5
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:54,000
Fifteen years later, both engaged to their respective fiancés, the
two discover that their annulment was never finalized.

6
00:20:09,599 --> 00:20:15,599
They reunite to make their divorce legal, but begin to
reminisce about what could have been.

7
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:37,200
When romantic feelings resurface, Annie and Ben must decide if
their past love could be the love of their future.

8
