00:47:02,400 --> 00:47:08,400
Annabella Avery Thorne (born October 8, 1997) is an
American actress, singer, and writer.

15
00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
She first received recognition for her roles as Margaux Darling in the series Dirty Sexy Money (2007–2008) and as Ruthy
Spivey in the drama series My Own Worst Enemy (2009), the latter of which earned her a Young Artist Award.

16
00:53:45,599 --> 00:53:51,599
Thorne gained prominence for her role as CeCe Jones on the Disney Channel series Shake It Up (2010–2013),
for which she received several awards and nominations, including winning an Imagen Award.

17
00:57:07,199 --> 00:57:13,199
Thorne has since appeared in numerous feature films, including Blended (2014), Alvin and
the Chipmunks: The Road Chip (2015), The Babysitter film series (2017–2020).

18
01:00:28,799 --> 01:00:34,799
She received praise for her roles in The DUFF (2015),
Amityville: The Awakening (2017), and Infamous (2020).

19
01:03:50,400 --> 01:03:56,400
Thorne also led the drama series Famous in Love (2017–2018), for which
she received nominations from the Teen Choice Awards.

20
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
Outside of acting, Thorne has ventured into music; she released her debut single,
"Watch Me" in 2011, which charted at 86 on the US Billboard Hot 100.

21
01:10:33,599 --> 01:10:39,599
She has since released the EP Made in Japan in 2012 and the EP Jersey in 2014.

22
01:13:55,199 --> 01:14:01,199
She made her directorial debut in 2019, directing the adult film Her & Him,
which garnered positive reviews and won a Pornhub Visionary Award.

23
01:17:16,800 --> 01:17:22,800
The film explores themes of ex-lover, marriage,
second chance, autumn, fall season.

24
01:20:38,399 --> 01:20:44,399
The tone is emotional.
